# Copy to .env.local for local overrides. Both are gitignored.
#
# Not needed for normal local development: the Vite dev server proxies /api to
# http://127.0.0.1:8000, so the default just works.

# Base URL of the API, including the /api/v1 prefix. Set this only when the
# frontend and the API are on different hosts, which is the case in production.
# VITE_API_BASE=https://footnote-api.onrender.com/api/v1

# Where the dev proxy forwards /api when the API is not on port 8000. This one
# is read by vite.config.ts from the shell, not from this file:
#   set VITE_PROXY_TARGET=http://127.0.0.1:8010 && npm run dev
